+| `FuncDef`, `Params` | `syntax.k:53-60` | `functions.k:14-16` installs the exact `closureVal` body |
+| `Call`, `Name` | `syntax.k:12,28` | `call.k:20-21`; `core.k:131-154` lookup; `call.k:69-74` frame creation |
